The compiler tells you that the line

model obj = {eta_row, dfcost_row, rep, logsigma_a, a1(i)};

has too many initializers (5) which makes sense because your model struct only has 4 members to set.
Removing the last

model obj = {eta_row, dfcost_row, rep, logsigma_a};

would make the code compile.

